sview (26.9+stereo3d5) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Save JPEG/JPS corrections through libstereo-policy's Qt-free JPEG
    codec; retain descriptor fields and opaque trailing data. Support
    indexed two-view MPO eye-order corrections and reload the saved order.
  * Write JPEG, JPS, MPO, PNG, Matroska and MP4 corrections to a sibling
    temporary file, verify metadata and image/packet content, then replace
    the unchanged original. Preserve file permissions and extended attributes.
  * Keep the 3D-only offer and per-file reset rules. Translate new refusal
    reasons into ten languages and complete Spanish's existing save reasons.
  * Exercise real files, independent parsers, corrupting editors, failed
    read-back and the actual MPO loader/save path in headless build tests.

